{"id":"concurrente.canales.canal-suma","lesson":"concurrente.canales","kind":"predecir","level":"semilla","required":true,"title":[{"type":"text","text":"The sum that arrives in parts"}],"statement":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Without running it, write exactly what this program shows."}]}],"restriction":[],"hints":[],"variant":[],"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"The producer sends 4, 5 and 6 and closes. The consumer adds each message and, when "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Recibir","identifier"]]},{"type":"text","text":" gives "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["Nada","literalBoolean"]]},{"type":"text","text":", it leaves the loop and writes 15."}]}],"program":{"id":"prediccion","title":"","source":"SubProceso Suspendible Produce(queue Como Canal<Entero>)\n  Para valor <- 4 Hasta 6 Hacer\n    Definir accepted Como Logico <- Aguardar queue.Enviar(valor);\n    Si No accepted Entonces\n      Escribir \"channel closed\";\n    FinSi\n  FinPara\n  queue.Cerrar();\nFinSubProceso\n\nSubProceso Suspendible AddUp(queue Como Canal<Entero>)\n  Definir total Como Entero <- 0;\n  Repetir\n    Segun Aguardar queue.Recibir() Hacer\n      Algo(valor): total <- total + valor;\n      Nada: Salir;\n    FinSegun\n  Hasta Que Falso\n  Escribir total;\nFinSubProceso\n\nAlgoritmo ChannelSum\n  Definir queue Como Canal<Entero> <- Canal(2);\n  Tareas\n    Lanzar Produce(queue);\n    Lanzar AddUp(queue);\n  FinTareas\nFinAlgoritmo\n","lines":[[["SubProceso","keywordProcedural"],[" "],["Suspendible","keywordStructured"],[" "],["Produce","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],["queue","identifier"],[" "],["Como","punctuation"],[" "],["Canal","type"],["<","operator"],["Entero","type"],[">","operator"],[")","punctuation"]],[["  "],["Para","keywordStructured"],[" "],["valor","identifier"],[" "],["<-","operator"],[" "],["4","literalNumber"],[" "],["Hasta","keywordStructured"],[" "],["6","literalNumber"],[" "],["Hacer","keywordStructured"]],[["    "],["D